11. Function to check positive,
negative, or zero; test
code:
def check_number(n):
    if n > 0:
        print(n, "is positive")
    elif n < 0:
        print(n, "is negative")
    else:
        print(n, "is zero")

check_number(10)
check_number(-5)
check_number(0)

